url: "https://github.com/Wonsik-Choi-janefather/wrra-m-0.1"
abstract: >-
  WRRA-M is a testable branch of the Wonsik Reality Renderer Architecture.
  It reinterprets the seven internal dimensions used in four-dimensional
  M-theory compactification as seven predimensional degrees rendered through
  a dimension filter. Its first structural calculation shows that one
  invariant channel plus two G2 seven-sectors has exactly the SU(3) color
  representation multiplicities of one Standard Model generation.
keywords:
